  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&#x2018;TECHNICAL SUPPORT FOR INTERNSHIPS FOR POVERTY REDUCTION AND DEVELOPMENT CAPACITY BUILDING&#x2019;.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall aim of the project is to support the longer-term professional capacity development of Irish-based students through experience of development work and life in a developing country, through a structured internship programme that will involve Irish-based university students spending five months working with development NGOs and other partners. The programme will provide direct assistance to partner organisations and UCC asserts that this will thereby increase their capacity to deliver on their development objectives, while simultaneously also contributing to poverty reduction.</narrative>
  </description>
